# InsightOps MVP

An AI-powered business investigation assistant backend and interactive dashboard designed to transform natural language business questions into structured, reproducible data analysis and root-cause findings.

---

## Architecture Overview

InsightOps bridges business queries to multi-source evidence using a modular stack:
* **API Layer**: FastAPI handling asynchronous request routing and CORS.
* **Frontend Layer**: Built-in interactive dark-mode dashboard for instant agentic investigation queries.
* **Orchestration & Tools (Mocked in MVP)**: Designed for LangGraph agent loops interacting with PostgreSQL (SQL execution), Qdrant (vector similarity search), and Docling (unstructured document parsing).

You can review the complete visual multi-agent workflow and layer breakdown in the [System Architecture Diagram](./insightops_architecture_diagram.pdf)[cite: 1].

